# Secrets the Deploy-to-Cloudflare flow prompts for.
#
# ONLY the two required ones are declared here on purpose. Provider API keys are
# deliberately absent: asking for ten keys before the first response is the exact
# wall this onboarding removes, and a fresh gateway already answers using
# Cloudflare Workers AI on your own account. Add providers later, from the chat
# app's Settings, when you actually want more capacity.

# Signs you in — from the chat app, Claude Code, Cursor or any other client.
KOMPASS_BEARER=""

# Encrypts provider API keys you add later, stored in your own KV namespace.
KOMPASS_MASTER_KEY=""
